<title>UK: Bankers Trust set warrants on the Nikkei 225 index.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust set warrants on the Nikkei 225 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International said it has issued one million warrants, in two equal tranches, on the Nikkei 225 index.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	05.FEB.97	  LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    100		  SPOT REFERENCE  20538.00</p>
<p>* * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TRANCHE  **NIKKEI 225 RANGE     PRICE    MAX PAYOUT</p>
<p> BEAR 3	 19200-21500	  US$1.10  US$2.00</p>
<p> BULL 3	 19750-22000	  US$1.00  US$2.00</p>
<p> NOTES    **THE WARRANT EXPIRES IMMEDIETELY THE INDEX TOUCHES</p>
<p>		OR BREAKS EITHER BARRIER.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
